      "proposition": "The majority will hold that the NVRA preserves Arizona's authority to enforce citizenship qualifications outside the Federal Form: Sections 20508 and 20506 permit documentary proof on Arizona's own form, and Section 20507's 90-day bar does not protect confirmed never-eligible noncitizens."
