    {
      "claim_id": "ground-breadth",
      "proposition": "The majority will state a medium-broad rule limited to state-developed forms and confirmed never-eligible noncitizens, while preserving the NVRA's federal-form backstop and its protection against systematic removal of people who were once eligible."
    }
